## Overview

Key Achievements
Developed quantitative bedside methemoglobin colour chart
Reduced propanil poisoning mortality from 9.5% to 3.1%
Incorporated into national clinical guidelines
Adopted internationally as a low-cost diagnostic tool

## Publications

* Ann Emerg Med. 2010
* Bull World Health Organ. 2016
* Clin Toxicol. 2016

## Impact

The bedside test improved antidote administration and reduced case fatality rates.
